                        <a name="md1">How do I What is member drive?</a><!--End-->
                        <h1>Member Drive</h1>
                        <p>Member Drive is our perishable items delivery system among our members.</p>

                        <a name="md2">How do I interact with member drive?</a><!--End-->
                        <h1>Interact</h1>
                        <p>When ording on the member platform you will have the ability to elect member drive from the app.</p>

                        <a name="md3">How do I track my deliveries?</a><!--End-->
                        <h1>Tracking</h1>
                        <p>Once orders are placed through the member drive network. You can track your delivery in real time.</p>

                        <a name="md4">How do I become a driver?</a><!--End-->
                        <h1>Become A Driver</h1>
                        <p>Our drivers are very important to our order fulfillment process. Any member can register to become a network participant from their member dash.</p>

                        <a name="md5">Is there a minimum purchase amount for member drive?</a><!--End-->
                        <h1>Minimum Purchase Amounts</h1>
                        <p>Yes, Currently the minimum purchase amount is $30.00 per order.</p>

                        <a name="md6">How are drivers paid?</a><!--End-->
                        <h1>Driver Payout</h1>
                        <p>The payment structure and member payouts as it relate to member drive pay can be found in your member drive network packet.</p>

                        <a name="shipping1">How do I recieve my items?</a><!--End-->
                        <h1>Shipping</h1>
                        <p>Orders for fresh vegetables and fruits that are perishable can only be ordered from with-in your pod. Our Member Drive &trade; co-operative members fill and close orders in as little as one hour.</p>
                        <p>
                            Our goal is to never create orders that cannot be filled in less than an hour. Due to the perishable nature of our grower member products over 50% of products will not be shipped out side of your pod. Location services on the market page ensures that we meet our goals of creating a responsive farm market experience. Our vision of a farm market without doors and
                            walls or any restrictions of your typical grocery store.
                        </p>
                        <p>For our grower members who purchase products from growers who produce products with a greater shelf life will be made available to you automatically on the market page without restrictions.</p>
